     "body": "<p>This issue is not a duplicate of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3130\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3130\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Complete implementation of OCFLPersistentStorageSession.rollback()\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3130\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n. \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3130\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3130\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Complete implementation of OCFLPersistentStorageSession.rollback()\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3130\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n is about implementing additional rollback features. This ticket is about fixing bugs in the existing rollback code.</p>",
